WEBVTT

00:02:59.926 --> 00:03:01.177
Fighter.

00:03:01.219 --> 00:03:02.845
I look at myself in the mirror.

00:03:02.887 --> 00:03:05.097
It felt OK at first,

00:03:05.097 --> 00:03:06.849
but soon it became exhausting,

00:03:06.891 --> 00:03:08.059
too heavy to lift,

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:11.103
too much to carry, too burdensome to bear.

00:03:11.437 --> 00:03:14.190
I took it off and left it on the floor.

00:03:14.232 --> 00:03:15.942
War was not for me.

00:03:15.983 --> 00:03:18.444
A body is not a battlefield."

00:03:20.238 --> 00:03:24.075
I realized that I had been introduced
to the fight narrative.

00:03:24.116 --> 00:03:26.911
When people heard my diagnosis,
I became a fighter.

00:03:26.953 --> 00:03:29.497
"You're a fighter," "Keep fighting,"

00:03:29.538 --> 00:03:31.707
"Beat this tumor,"
were the top comments.